Everything listed below is missing from this public repository on purpose:
it was extracted from (or derived from) The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth +
Repentance game files and is not ours to redistribute. To make this
checkout buildable, place the equivalent files at the listed paths,
relative to this file's directory (assets/).

Notes:
- The frontend imports these assets statically; the app does not build
  or run without them.
- Paths under *_outlined/ and the 6x upscaled variants are not raw game
  files — extract the raw art first, then regenerate the variants with the
  bundled scripts (scripts/: copy_floor_textures.py, upscale_all_sprites.py,
  upscale_pixel_art.py, outline_hearts.py, outline_active_items.py,
  trim_minimap_tiles.py).

